# Earthbender Ascension: once the reflexive trigger is on the stack it is independent of the enchantment (CR 603.12, 113.7a). The fourth quest counter on
# turn 5 puts it on the stack targeting the Ornithopter; in response Bot2 destroys the Ascension with Disenchant. The trigger's "if it has four or more
# quest counters on it" is judged on the Ascension as it last existed (CR 603.4, 608.2h): it had four, so the trigger resolves, the Ornithopter gets
# the +1/+1 counter and trample until end of turn, though the enchantment is in the graveyard.

